14	 * order, from a process-wide counter.
15	 *
16	 * <p>{@code customerCode} carries the owner's <em>current primary identifier</em>. It is sourced from
17	 * a single accessor ({@link Owner#getCustomerCode()}); when the customer code is later unified into a
18	 * member id, that accessor changes and the event carries the member id instead, without touching this
19	 * class.
